Z||000007||theogre||06-16-2001||11:24 PM||||The only one that applies to you is the one we keep covering over and over. 4L60 and 440T4 I think are the numbers it goes by. Or maybe it's 4T60 and 440L4... I can't rememeber right now... It's esentially a TH125C with an overdrive. You need a couple brackets and different axles to use it. Otherwise it's basically drop in. No big structural or engine issues.||||reg||1
